# The disassembly index is derived from the copyrighted Imperialism.exe: it
# embeds the original instruction stream verbatim. Build it locally, never
# commit it. tools/alf/index.py defaults to a path outside the repo anyway.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.alfdb

.DS_Store
